{"id": "official:sentence:4f1089c8-fbe1-44d0-b9e7-9d4ff8acac3f", "text": "你喜欢喝法国的葡萄酒吗？", "shortMeaning": "法国葡萄酒你爱喝吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
