{"id": "official:sentence:46963404-bec6-4ad2-9a3f-06a76a1c343e", "text": "你喜欢的歌手是谁？", "shortMeaning": "你追哪位歌手？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cbf00230-226c-4125-ac9c-060e204e6759", "text": "你喜欢盗版电影吗？", "shortMeaning": "你爱看盗版电影吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eaffb8a7-4bab-4e1c-bbf8-d6d9881813cc", "text": "你喜欢芝士汉堡吗？", "shortMeaning": "芝士汉堡你爱不爱吃？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fea95248-7a95-4db7-95d2-1ef9b6ffddc6", "text": "你喜欢蓝色的还是红色的？", "shortMeaning": "你要蓝的还是红的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e41de32-9dc3-4292-96aa-b822bcdd5883", "text": "你喜欢讨论建筑，不是吗？", "shortMeaning": "你爱聊建筑，对吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3812c358-3d06-4ee6-b821-c33df2c93140", "text": "你喜欢说唱音乐吗？", "shortMeaning": "说唱你爱听吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4556f22a-db70-43a5-8a93-7eb48fd377c3", "text": "你喜欢这个城市吗？", "shortMeaning": "你对这座城市的印象好吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3bcfcf68-8045-4d02-a2dc-f9785e85df15", "text": "你喜欢这个电玩吗？", "shortMeaning": "这游戏你爱玩吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f4368a18-30dd-4e60-8dc2-028758038e0b", "text": "你喜欢这座城市吗？", "shortMeaning": "这座城市你中意吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fc83d2d3-4e6e-4e0f-a3a4-887f2b0030ef", "text": "你喜欢钓鱼吗？我们可以选一天一起去钓。", "shortMeaning": "你爱钓鱼吗？挑一天我们一起去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a417cfb-c33c-4751-ae4f-d1479101746a", "text": "你太喜欢说他人坏话了。", "shortMeaning": "你太爱讲别人闲话了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8c8e3f26-8ad4-4af4-808a-58b9ec436510", "text": "你太担心你的体重了。", "shortMeaning": "你对自己的体重太在意了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fef7d93f-3b1d-4ef8-95bb-f85454d09a3c", "text": "你如果高兴，就吃一点吧。", "shortMeaning": "你愿意的话就吃点吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:58284fd7-98be-4a93-9406-fd640ce029c6", "text": "你宁愿说谎也不愿让他生气吗？", "shortMeaning": "你宁可撒谎，也不愿惹他生气？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aa40bfb2-3591-48f5-981f-f4e67191b845", "text": "你害怕被炒鱿鱼吗？", "shortMeaning": "你怕被解雇吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cbca2035-35ef-4fc5-81c2-0ef758c7931a", "text": "你很快就会喜欢上这个城市。", "shortMeaning": "你很快会喜欢上这里的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cee27728-1bf7-494e-a39e-bae7893e98cd", "text": "你更喜欢什么颜色？蓝色还是红色？", "shortMeaning": "你更喜欢哪个颜色，蓝的还是红的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b26a4d30-215b-4a9a-b8ff-1e78b154dcc7", "text": "你更喜欢哪个牌子？", "shortMeaning": "你更偏哪个牌子？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:24c1ede2-99ee-417c-a785-08bea89ecfb2", "text": "你更喜欢哪个，这个还是那个？", "shortMeaning": "这两个你更爱哪一个？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8be2c828-27ae-418c-bdb1-6f3d1fce417e", "text": "你更喜欢哪条裙子？", "shortMeaning": "哪条裙子你更中意？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3db7371b-d09c-4ad5-81c1-e4e057328641", "text": "你最喜欢什么披萨？", "shortMeaning": "你最爱的披萨是哪种？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9dd24e80-a4cc-4f8e-bcbd-5655b4d89207", "text": "你最喜欢什么样的人？", "shortMeaning": "你最喜欢哪种性格的人？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e524ce85-54ee-47e9-8085-9ab06f7430a1", "text": "你最喜欢什么电视剧？", "shortMeaning": "最爱看哪部电视剧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9b0664b1-f289-42d1-ace0-314f2661bed7", "text": "你最喜欢什么蔬菜？", "shortMeaning": "蔬菜里你最爱吃哪样？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76f84837-376d-4a80-8039-7e4c3e295afe", "text": "你最喜欢什么运动？", "shortMeaning": "你最爱哪项运动？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bd5ce39b-bdac-4fb5-af20-55ed6988951a", "text": "你最喜欢去日本的什么地方度假？", "shortMeaning": "日本哪里是你最想去度假的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00f7ce29-fdf6-4e9a-bec5-62e71ee394d5", "text": "你最喜欢哪一个绕口令？", "shortMeaning": "你最爱说哪段绕口令？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
